   <media:description>Take a look behind the scenes of the BR-X3 Micro Rotor and discover the precision behind every detail. From the semi-skeletonized architecture to the integrated micro-rotor movement, each component reflects Bell &amp; Ross’ dedication to contemporary watchmaking

